```bash
flutter create --org com.yourdomain app_name
cd app_name
```

Key considerations:
- Use meaningful package name matching your domain (reverse domain notation)
- Organization typically follows company/personal domain pattern
- App name should be kebab-case for CLI, but displayed name will be formatted

